  "description": "Epic Range with Dual Batteries: Equipped with a dual 48V 13Ah (26Ah total) battery system, allowing for an exceptional range of 80–120+ miles, significantly reducing range anxiety for long-distance travel.\n\nHigh-Performance Power: Features a 1500W peak motor that delivers exhilarating acceleration, reaching a top speed of 32 mph and easily conquering 30° inclines.\n\nFull Suspension Comfort: Features a full suspension setup, combining a hydraulic lockout front suspension fork and a dual-spring rear shock, delivering a smooth, cushioned ride. Paired with a plush, extra-wide saddle for all-day comfort.\n\nRugged All-Terrain Performance: Equipped with ultra-wide 20\" x 4.0\" CST fat tires and a 330 lb payload capacity, providing superior traction and heavy-duty stability across city streets, sand, or gravel.\n\nSmart Features & Safety: Includes a smart color LCD display with USB charging, NFC unlock, retro high-brightness LED headlight, and integrated rear turn signals for enhanced visibility and safety.",
